aster", "roller", "coaster", "simulator"], "long_description": "With Rilix Coaster App you can enjoy the best of virtual reality games on the market. With scenarios exclusively developed for the roller coaster simulator, Rilix Coaster, are available for Rilix customers.\n\nUsers with GearVR may experience one of the most wanted simulator scenarios. The Diamond Cave will make you feel a little taste of what it's like on a roller coaster really.\n\nDeveloped with the highest technology in the market, the Rilix Coaster is featured in Brazil and spread to worldwide. His scenarios are to hold your breath and make users traveling by unfamiliar places using virtual reality.\n\nTo live a hallucinatory experience and a 100% immersion, look for the nearest Rilix Coaster from you at rilix.co and discover other experiences!\n\nRilix - Real Life Experience", "short_description": "With Rilix Coaster App you can enjoy the best of virtual reality games on the market. With scenarios exclusively developed for the roller coaster simulator, Rilix Coaster, are available for Rilix customers. Users with GearVR may experience one of the most wanted simulator scenarios: the Diamond Cave. To live a hallucinatory experience with 100% immersion, look for the nearest Rilix Coaster from you at rilix.co and discover other experiences!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": null, "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rilix", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.rilix.com.br/", "category": "GALLERY", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "pt_BR", "es"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_pl